            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nI can reproduce. Although I am having hard time figuring out the actual reason why this happens, as the `<C-\\>` Terminal mode mapping for 'toggleterm' is there. It might have something to do with how 'toggleterm.nvim' tracks data which is not compatible with `MiniPick.ui_select()`. I'll take a look.",
